WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
First Session: a tutor simulator with three constructed students (fictional program: Bridge Math Tutoring)

2
00:00:03.011 --> 00:00:08.018
Before you start: the moves you'll practice, named as in the companion tutoring courses

3
00:00:08.018 --> 00:00:12.023
The session: three simulated students, one 30-minute routine

4
00:00:12.023 --> 00:00:19.026
A short captioned establishing shot, skippable from the first frame

5
00:00:19.026 --> 00:00:21.031
Skip any cinematic (Esc)

6
00:00:21.031 --> 00:00:26.035
Read the cues: who is stuck, who is quiet, who is racing ahead

7
00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:31.037
Choose a move. Students respond to the move, not the wording

8
00:00:31.037 --> 00:00:37.039
Practice wait time: hold the silence and see what happens

9
00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:42.040
Every choice is logged for the debrief timeline

10
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:47.543
Debrief: replay the session moment by moment, mapped to five competency domains

11
00:00:47.543 --> 00:00:52.045
Every cue and decision also works in text mode

12
00:00:52.045 --> 00:00:56.049
Practice only, not an assessment of tutors. Play free at immersive-learning-showcase.vercel.app
